NOTICE — third-party material in audio-provenance-sdk/tools/capture-rig

NOTHING IS VENDORED. This directory contains no third-party source and no third-party model weights.
Every file under src/, tests/ and configs/ was written for this project.

Reimplemented from published descriptions, with no third-party code consulted line by line:

  - Farina's exponential sine sweep and its amplitude-corrected time-reversed inverse filter, and the
    harmonic pre-arrival relation dt_k = T*ln(k)/ln(f2/f1), in src/capture_rig/signals.py and
    src/capture_rig/sweep.py. Published method (Farina, AES 108, 2000).
  - Schroeder backward integration and T30 extrapolation, in src/capture_rig/acoustics.py.
    Independently implemented rather than imported from ../../training, which is owned by another
    workstream; the two are cross-checked in tests/test_acoustics.py.
  - Lundeby-style noise-floor truncation of the decay curve, in src/capture_rig/acoustics.py.
  - The IEC 61672-1 A-weighting transfer function, evaluated analytically. Verified against the
    published table at 31.5 Hz, 100 Hz, 1 kHz, 10 kHz and 20 kHz in tests/test_acoustics.py.
  - The ACE Challenge direct-to-reverberant ratio convention (a +/- 2.5 ms window around the direct
    peak), in src/capture_rig/acoustics.py.
  - Generalised cross-correlation with phase transform (Knapp and Carter, 1976), in
    src/capture_rig/alignment/locate.py.

Runtime dependencies are declared in pyproject.toml and installed from PyPI; their licences are their
own and none of their source is copied into this tree. They are numpy, scipy, soundfile (libsndfile),
sounddevice (PortAudio) and PyYAML.

NO WATERMARKING MODEL, CODE OR WEIGHTS OF ANY KIND IS PRESENT HERE. This tool plays audio, records
audio, measures rooms, and calls a detector through an adapter. Which detector is a runtime argument.
The licence constraints recorded in ../../training/NOTICE — AudioSeal MIT on code and weights,
SilentCipher weights carrying no grant, DeepAWR's defective chain of title, DeAR unlicensed — apply
to whatever is placed behind that adapter, and this directory carries none of it.

This directory is part of audio-provenance-sdk and is Apache-2.0, matching the workspace.
